return {
    ["1.可以单人或双人组队进入副本，选择单/双人模式不影响奖励。\n2.战士和观众进入副本后会强制切换为输出形态。"] = "1. You can enter dungeons solo or in a party of two; choosing solo/duo mode does not affect rewards. \n2. Warriors and Spectators will be forced to switch to Offensive Stance upon entering a dungeon.",
