    ["5230132   廷根   位面"] = "5230132 Tingen Plane",
    ["<M_Default>亲爱的非凡者：</>\n<M_Default>您在副本中达到征服皇帝段位，以下是您的称号奖励。</>"] = "<M_Default>Dear Beyonder: </>\n<M_Default>You have reached the rank of Emperor of Conquest in the Dungeon. Below are your title rewards.</>",
    ["<M_Red>「完整填写问卷，将获得400绑定金镑！」</>\n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"web=%s\">公测调研问卷3</>\n亲爱的非凡者：\n      这些时日以来，您已在廷根留下了不少足迹。您的每一次战斗、每一次选择、每一次对这个世界产生的好奇心，都为我们照亮了前路。\n      此时此刻，随着体验和扮演的深入，您对这个世界是否有了更清晰的认知？有哪些内容让您印象深刻，又有哪些地方让您感到困惑或不够完善？这不仅仅是一次问卷，更是您为这个世界持续完善，所投下的重要一票。\n      您所传递的一切声音，都将成为指引我们前行的明灯。\n      感谢您为这世界带来的改变。祝愿您早日消化魔药，掌控非凡。"] = "<M_Red>「Complete the questionnaire and receive 400 Bound Pounds!」</>\n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"web=%s\">Public Beta Survey 3</>\nDear Beyonder:\n      Over these days, you have left quite a few footprints in Tingen. Every battle, every choice, and every curiosity you have had about this world has illuminated the path forward for us. \n      At this very moment, as your experience and acting deepen, do you have a clearer understanding of this world? What content has left a deep impression on you, and what areas make you feel confused or imperfect? This is not just a questionnaire, but an important vote you are casting for the continuous improvement of this world. \n      Every voice you convey will become a beacon guiding us forward. \n      Thank you for the changes you have brought to this world. May you digest your potion and master your Extraordinary powers soon.",
    ["<P_Heart>然后，为了达成这个目的，我最需要的途径能力是……</>"] = "<P_Heart>Then, to achieve this goal, the pathway ability I need most is...</>",
